{"id": "895dc4ac-9ad6-45ee-87be-4fe9c8139937", "slug": "system-framework-v3-0", "title": "System Framework v3.0", "description": "System Framework Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"System Framework v3.0\"\ndescription: \"System Framework Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF0B0B\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF0B0B\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"2px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Framework v3.0\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 70; favorites: 7; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, charts, navigation.\n## Overview\nSystem Framework Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nKinetix Engine Telemetry Nodes Diagnostics Authenticate Execute Build System Framework v3.0 // Beta Phase Algorithmic spatial type systems. Convert static vectors into a dynamically governed, interdependent dimensional…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Algorithmic spatial type systems.; Architected for dimensional fidelity; Tensile Dynamic Simulation; Dimensional Z-Extrusion; Sequenced Spatial Stagger.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF0B0B, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF0B0B, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Framework v3.0</title>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#000000] text-zinc-300 antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#FF0B0B]/20 selection:text-[#FF0B0B]\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Persistent Spatial Rhythm Grid -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Three.js Background Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Master Framed Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-screen border-x border-white/10 z-10 flex flex-col\" style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) 1;\">\n\n        <!-- Tactical Corner Brackets -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"sticky top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-[22.4px] py-[16.8px] border-b border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md bg-black/60\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-[11.2px] text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:align-horizonta-spacing-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-[#FF0B0B]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Kinetix Engine</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[33.6px] text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#FF0B0B] transition-colors\" style=\"transition-duration: 200ms;\">Telemetry</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#FF0B0B] transition-colors\" style=\"transition-duration: 200ms;\">Nodes</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#FF0B0B] transition-colors\" style=\"transition-duration: 200ms;\">Diagnostics</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-[16.8px]\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#FF0B0B] transition-colors\" style=\"transition-duration: 200ms;\">Authenticate</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-white px-[16.8px] py-[8.4px] rounded-[2px] text-sm font-medium hover:border-[#FF0B0B] hover:text-[#FF0B0B] transition-all\" style=\"transition-duration: 300ms;\">Execute Build</a>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Main Content -->\n        <main class=\"relative z-10 pt-[96px] pb-[96px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[85vh] px-[22.4px]\">\n\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-[11.2px] px-[16.8px] py-[8.4px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-zinc-300 text-xs font-normal mb-[44.8px] backdrop-blur-md\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-sm text-[#FF0B0B]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                System Framework v3.0 // Beta Phase\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Independent 3D Stage -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-6xl flex justify-center items-center py-[96px] cursor-crosshair\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n                <div id=\"kinetic-scene\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-[5.6px] md:gap-[16.8px] lg:gap-[22.4px]\">\n                    <!-- Independent letters injected via JS -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-2xl text-center mt-[44.8px]\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light text-white mb-[22.4px] drop-shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] tracking-tight\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.05em;\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Algorithmic spatial</span></span><br>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">type systems.</span></span>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-zinc-400 font-normal mb-[33.6px] leading-relaxed\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Convert static vectors into a dynamically governed,</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">interdependent dimensional framework. Each glyph</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">operates as an autonomous node guided by tensile physics.</span></span>\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-[16.8px] overflow-hidden\">\n                    <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%] w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                        <button class=\"w-full px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] rounded-[2px] bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[#FF0B0B] hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                            Initialize Sandbox\n                        </button>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%] w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                        <button class=\"w-full px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/10 bg-black/50 text-white text-sm font-normal hover:border-[#FF0B0B] hover:text-[#FF0B0B] transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-[11.2px] backdrop-blur-md\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            View Telemetry\n                        </button>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Architecture Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative z-10 w-full px-[22.4px] py-[96px] border-t border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <div class=\"mb-[67.2px]\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-white mb-[16.8px] tracking-tight\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.05em;\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Architected for dimensional fidelity</span></span>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-zinc-400 font-normal max-w-xl leading-relaxed\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">An optimized calculation pipeline processing typography</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">as structural masses, generating cinematic parallax</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">devoid of standard WebGL constraints.</span></span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-[22.4px]\">\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"p-[33.6px] rounded-[2px] bg-black border border-white/5 hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/50 hover:bg-zinc-900/20 transition-all group\" style=\"transition-duration: 400ms;\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-[2px] bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-[#FF0B0B] mb-[22.4px] border border-white/10 group-hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/30 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ruler-cross-pen-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-white mb-[11.2px] tracking-tight\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.05em;\">Tensile Dynamic Simulation</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-normal leading-relaxed\">Nodes respond via computed elasticity and dampening protocols, yielding measurable weight, polarity, and structural mass.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"p-[33.6px] rounded-[2px] bg-black border border-white/5 hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/50 hover:bg-zinc-900/20 transition-all group\" style=\"transition-duration: 400ms;\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-[2px] bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-[#FF0B0B] mb-[22.4px] border border-white/10 group-hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/30 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-white mb-[11.2px] tracking-tight\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.05em;\">Dimensional Z-Extrusion</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-normal leading-relaxed\">Every node commands a discrete spatial array. Leading edges reflect ambient values while lateral planes transition into absolute void.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"p-[33.6px] rounded-[2px] bg-black border border-white/5 hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/50 hover:bg-zinc-900/20 transition-all group\" style=\"transition-duration: 400ms;\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-[2px] bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-[#FF0B0B] mb-[22.4px] border border-white/10 group-hover:border-[#FF0B0B]/30 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-light text-white mb-[11.2px] tracking-tight\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.05em;\">Sequenced Spatial Stagger</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-normal leading-relaxed\">Input events propagate across the matrix. Proximity vectors induce latent motion waves, elevating discrete nodes along the Z-axis.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"relative z-10 border-t border-white/10 py-[33.6px] text-center bg-black backdrop-blur-md\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 font-normal tracking-wide\">\n                &copy; 2024 Kinetic Platform. Engineered for the spatial web.\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Background WebGL Shader Script -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-bg');\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n\n        const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            uniforms: {\n                u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) }\n            },\n            vertexShader: `\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                void main() {\n                    vUv = uv;\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                }\n            `,\n            fragmentShader: `\n                uniform float u_time;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                float rand(vec2 co){\n                    return fract(sin(dot(co.xy ,vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453);\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    // Vertical stepped columns\n                    float cols = 12.0;\n                    float stepX = floor(vUv.x * cols) / cols;\n\n                    // Column wave animation\n                    float colVal = sin(stepX * 8.0 + u_time * 0.5) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n                    // Grainy noise-perturbed edges\n                    float noise = (rand(vUv * u_time * 0.1) - 0.5) * 0.15;\n                    float intensity = colVal + noise;\n\n                    // Dithered color mapping\n                    vec3 color = mix(vec3(0.0), vec3(0.1, 0.1, 0.12), intensity);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                }\n            `\n        });\n\n        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        scene.add(mesh);\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            material.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n\n        function renderGL(time) {\n            material.uniforms.u_time.value = time * 0.001;\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            requestAnimationFrame(renderGL);\n        }\n        requestAnimationFrame(renderGL);\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Interactive Modular Script & GSAP -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // GSAP Clinical Interface Reveal\n            gsap.to(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.08,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            const scene = document.getElementById('kinetic-scene');\n            const word = \"KINETIC\";\n            const layerCount = 24;\n            const depthSpacing = 1.8;\n            const letters = [];\n\n            // Build independent DOM structures\n            word.split('').forEach((char, index) => {\n                const group = document.createElement('div');\n                group.className = \"relative z-10\";\n                group.style.perspective = \"1200px\";\n\n                const pivot = document.createElement('div');\n                pivot.className = \"relative text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light tracking-tight uppercase cursor-default\";\n                pivot.style.transformStyle = 'preserve-3d';\n                pivot.style.willChange = 'transform';\n                pivot.style.letterSpacing = '-0.05em';\n\n                const frontFaces = [];\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < layerCount; i++) {\n                    const span = document.createElement('span');\n                    span.textContent = char;\n\n                    if (i === 0) {\n                        span.className = \"relative block drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\";\n                        span.style.transform = `translateZ(0px)`;\n                        span.style.color = '#ffffff';\n                        frontFaces.push(span);\n                    } else {\n                        span.className = \"absolute top-0 left-0 block pointer-events-none select-none\";\n                        span.style.transform = `translateZ(${-i * depthSpacing}px)`;\n\n                        const depthRatio = i / layerCount;\n\n                        // Technical grayscale with subtle red shift deeper in the stack\n                        const r = 255 - (255 * depthRatio * 0.8);\n                        const g = 255 - (255 * depthRatio);\n                        const b = 255 - (255 * depthRatio);\n\n                        const a = 1 - (depthRatio * 0.5);\n                        span.style.color = `rgba(${r}, ${g}, ${b}, ${a})`;\n\n                        if (i % 3 === 0 && i < 12) {\n                            span.style.textShadow = `0 0 2px rgba(255, 11, 11, 0.2)`;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    pivot.appendChild(span);\n                }\n\n                group.appendChild(pivot);\n                scene.appendChild(group);\n\n                const centerIdx = (word.length - 1) / 2;\n                const distFromCenter = Math.abs(index - centerIdx);\n                const reactivity = 1 + (distFromCenter * 0.35);\n                const alternateDir = index % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\n\n                letters.push({\n                    el: pivot,\n                    front: frontFaces[0],\n                    idx: index,\n                    react: reactivity,\n                    dir: alternateDir,\n                    rx: 0, ry: 0, rz: 0, tz: 0,\n                    vx: 0, vy: 0, vz: 0, vtz: 0,\n                });\n            });\n\n            let mouseX = 0, mouseY = 0;\n            let isHovering = false;\n            let time = 0;\n\n            const historyLength = 40;\n            const mouseHistory = Array(historyLength).fill({x: 0, y: 0});\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                isHovering = true;\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;\n                mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;\n            });\n\n            document.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                isHovering = false;\n                mouseX = 0; mouseY = 0;\n            });\n\n            function animate() {\n                time += 0.02;\n\n                mouseHistory.unshift({x: mouseX, y: mouseY});\n                if (mouseHistory.length > historyLength) mouseHistory.pop();\n\n                letters.forEach((l) => {\n                    let targetRx = 0, targetRy = 0, targetRz = 0, targetTz = 0;\n\n                    if (isHovering) {\n                        const historyIdx = Math.min(historyLength - 1, l.idx * 4);\n                        const delayedMouse = mouseHistory[historyIdx];\n\n                        const mx = delayedMouse.x;\n                        const my = delayedMouse.y;\n\n                        targetRy = mx * 35 * l.react;\n                        targetRx = -my * 25 * l.react;\n                        targetRz = (mx * my) * 8 * l.dir;\n\n                        const normalizedIdx = (l.idx / (word.length - 1)) * 2 - 1;\n                        const distToMouse = Math.abs(mx - normalizedIdx);\n                        targetTz = Math.max(0, 1 - distToMouse * 1.5) * 60;\n\n                    } else {\n                        targetRy = Math.sin(time + l.idx * 0.4) * 12 * l.dir;\n                        targetRx = Math.cos(time * 0.7 + l.idx * 0.3) * 8;\n                        targetRz = Math.sin(time * 0.5 + l.idx * 0.2) * 4 * l.dir;\n                        targetTz = Math.sin(time + l.idx * 0.6) * 10;\n                    }\n\n                    const tension = 0.06;\n                    const friction = 0.78;\n\n                    l.vx += (targetRx - l.rx) * tension;\n                    l.vy += (targetRy - l.ry) * tension;\n                    l.vz += (targetRz - l.rz) * tension;\n                    l.vtz += (targetTz - l.tz) * tension;\n\n                    l.vx *= friction;\n                    l.vy *= friction;\n                    l.vz *= friction;\n                    l.vtz *= friction;\n\n                    l.rx += l.vx;\n                    l.ry += l.vy;\n                    l.rz += l.vz;\n                    l.tz += l.vtz;\n\n                    l.el.style.transform = `translateZ(${l.tz}px) rotateX(${l.rx}deg) rotateY(${l.ry}deg) rotateZ(${l.rz}deg)`;\n\n                    const shinePos = ((time * 30 + l.idx * 15) % 200) - 50;\n                    const frontStyle = l.front.style;\n                    frontStyle.backgroundImage = `linear-gradient(110deg, rgba(255,255,255,1) ${shinePos - 15}%, rgba(255,11,11,1) ${shinePos}%, rgba(255,255,255,1) ${shinePos + 15}%)`;\n                    frontStyle.backgroundClip = 'text';\n                    frontStyle.WebkitBackgroundClip = 'text';\n                    frontStyle.color = 'transparent';\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-framework-v3-0.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/system-framework-v3-0.jpg", "source_name": "system-framework-v3-0-DESIGN.md", "views": 164, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T08:45:54.66466+00:00"}